Skills: SDD

Purpose:
  Skill Intelligence and Self-Evolution Engine. Skills are living
  engineering knowledge packages organized by technology and competency
  layers (L1-L5). Each programming language has layered skills from
  fundamentals to architecture.

Owns: ./

